{"c":[{"id":"ddb89e6a53056b50","sum":"Tiers are hand-set and not monotone in score, so an unmatched effort placed from score-neighbors can land in S above its own A sibling. The catalog ranks the model stem. The printed reviewer keeps the effort on its own spelling.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260923T232506Z-24460cae37479591","text":"choose-verification-model place_effort takes tier from score-neighbors, but hand-set tiers are not monotone in score (kimi-k3-high A 77.87 > opus S 77.07): kimi-k3-low/medium place as S above their A sibling. Interpolated score is order-identical to just-beside-sibling.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260923T232738Z-a3126083d6a8469e","text":"choose-verification-model ranks the BenchLM model, not the effort. Catalog keys are stems and effort_encoded is false. The printed reviewer keeps the effort on the first --reviewer-models spelling of that model.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"28289b6c2ca70178","sum":"BenchLM slugs use dashes; Cursor stems use dots, cursor- prefixes, and -thinking. Match by word sets. Tiers are hand-set trust, not score order (kimi-k3 A above opus S). New models get a hand tier; do not derive a tier from score neighbors.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260924T004708Z-e3de1689c901c73d","text":"BenchLM slugs use dashes (gpt-5-6-sol); Cursor stems use dots (gpt-5.6-sol), cursor- prefixes, and -thinking. Direct scores[model_key(slug)] hits 2 of 12 live Task slugs; dots-to-dashes hits 9. BenchLM also has real -thinking slugs (claude-opus-4-5-thinking).","type":"note"},{"name":"20260924T133144Z-b367cb7052eb77f8","text":"choose-verification-model tiers are the operator's trust calibration, not a function of score (kimi-k3 A above opus S is intended). Never derive a tier from score neighbors. New models are onboarded with a hand tier the hour they ship; outside-author placement is not needed.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
